{"articleNo":"1655","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1655&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 졸업앨범비 납부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.03.17","hit":"9042","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">29대 졸업준비위원회입니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2011학년도 졸업앨범 및 액자</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">를 신청할 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">원스톱</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> → </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">학생</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> → </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">졸업앨범비고지서</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">를 출력하여 고지서에 있는 편리한 은행에 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">31</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">일(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">목</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">)까지 납부하여 주시면 감사하겠습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">또한 졸업앨범과 증명사진 및 액자는 각각 신청할 수 있습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;원스톱을 통하여 납부하시는 분들은 졸업앨범과 액자를 모두 신청하시는 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">분들만 하여주시고, 졸업 앨범이나 액자 또는 증명사진 중 필요하신 것만 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">선택하실 경우 아래의 계좌로 학번과 성명을 기재하여 각 금액에 알맞은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">금액을 계좌이체하여 주시면 감사하겠습니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">(졸업준비위원회 사무실에 방문하여 직접납부는 받지 않습니다.)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">증명사진(촬영만 할 경우)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">=10,000원<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">졸업앨범+액자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">=85,000원<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">졸업앨범</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">=55,000원<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">학사모액자사진</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">=30,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">*농협 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">302-0366-7897-91 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">*우체국 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">703546-02-153001</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">*예금주 박정현(졸업준비위원장)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">※ 문의사항</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;1. 졸업준비위원회 사무실 : 054-478-6809(학생회관 109-1호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;2. 졸업준비위원장 : 010-2550-4345</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;3. 졸업준비부위원장 : 010-4623-2352</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2011년 3월 17일</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">제29대 서/포/터/즈 졸업준비위원회</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t